WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.368
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.903
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're all doing well.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.571
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:06.839
President Biden

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:09.875
and Chinese President Xi Jinping
agreed yesterday

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:12.378
to reestablish
military communications.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.380
It's what Biden is calling

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.749
the greatest
US-China collaboration

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:18.551
since "Rush Hour."

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:20.386
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:21.887
Needed that one
to go well tonight

00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:23.556
'cause he's on the show.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:24.690
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.326
The White House said yesterday

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:29.261
that President Biden will sign
a continuing resolution

00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:33.098
to keep the government funded
through January 19th.

00:00:33.098 --> 00:00:35.434
So now we can finally
put this all behind us,

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:37.103
and also in front of us.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.371
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.706
After he challenged a witness

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.641
testifying before
a Senate committee yesterday

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.443
to a physical fight,
Oklahoma Senator

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.545
Markwayne Mullin
told Fox News

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:48.114
he was representing
"Oklahoma values."

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:51.918
Though based on his behavior,
I have to assume Oklahoma values

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:54.320
is a dollar store
outside of Tulsa.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.155
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:59.292
Oh, there's a lot of fights
at Oklahoma Valuez.

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:00.626
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:02.294
After he challenged
the president

00:01:02.294 --> 00:01:03.929
of the Teamsters union
to a fight,

00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:05.564
Oklahoma Senator
Markwayne Mullin

00:01:05.564 --> 00:01:08.201
discussed his combat strategy
with reporters yesterday

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:10.970
and said, "In a fight,
I'm gonna bite.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.005
I'll do anything.
I'm not above it.

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:16.342
And I don't care
where I bite, by the way."

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:19.178
So, you're definitely
threatening to bite his penis.

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:20.479
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.479 --> 00:01:23.416
Even Jeffrey Dahmer is like,
"This guy is unwell."

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.885
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.020
Embattled New York
Congressman George Santos

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:30.123
announced today that he
will not seek re-election.

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:32.424
However, he asked voters
to consider

00:01:32.424 --> 00:01:34.593
casting their ballot
in the next election

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:36.762
for Georgina Diablos.

00:01:36.762 --> 00:01:39.765
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:42.368
In a new interview,
Disney CEO Bob Iger said

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.903
the company is developing
a third "Frozen" movie

00:01:44.903 --> 00:01:48.374
and added there might be
a "Frozen 4" in the works, too.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.143
Kind of surprising
for a franchise

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:52.979
whose signature song is
"Let It Go."

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:55.314
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.314 --> 00:01:57.816
A production company in London
announced this week

00:01:57.816 --> 00:02:00.253
a musical based on
actress Gwyneth Paltrow's

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:02.922
skiing collision trial
will open next month.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.724
"We should go," said someone

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:07.060
halfway through the first act.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.095
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:10.429
[whispering]
This was a bad idea.

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:11.431
We should go.

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:12.731
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.731 --> 00:02:14.066
It was announced yesterday

00:02:14.066 --> 00:02:16.702
that the Beast's Library
attraction at Disneyland

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:18.037
will permanently close
next month.

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:19.171
Wow!

00:02:19.171 --> 00:02:21.508
Closing a Disney attraction
and a library --

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:24.344
that's like
Ron DeSantis' best day.

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:26.346
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.652
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:34.787
And finally,
CBS this week announced

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.689
that it's canceling its show
"Young Sheldon."

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:39.859
Man! And just after Fox canceled
"Old Sheldon."

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:40.860
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.594
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:02:42.594 --> 00:02:43.930
We're off and running.

